		"description": {
			"value": "<p>Your bites carry a cursed infection. When you hit and deal damage to a creature with a jaws Strike while in hybrid or rat shape, the creature is cursed until the start of your next turn. Whenever they regain Hit Points during that time, they must attempt a @Check[fortitude|against:class-spell] save against your class DC or spell DC, whichever is higher.</p><hr><p>Success The creature regains Hit Points normally.</p><p>Failure The creature regains half the normal Hit Points.</p><p>Critical Failure The creature regains no Hit Points.</p>",
